  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to End Modern Slavery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Fund to End Modern Slavery (GFEMS) proposes a new approach to tackling modern slavery, with transformational programs and the development of a $1.5 billion fund. With PEMS seed funding, GFEMS will work to secure already-identified government and private sector matching contributions, bringing in unprecedented resources to amplify the United States&apos; leadership on this issue. This Fund will pool resources and coordinate a coherent strategy to reduce modern slavery in targeted populations.</narrative>
  </description>
